Wait here.

252
00:32:04,006 --> 00:32:06,467
Let's go.

253
00:34:04,835 --> 00:34:06,962
There you go.

254
00:34:46,961 --> 00:34:48,337
Tam!

255
00:34:52,341 --> 00:34:54,385
Tam!

256
00:34:57,805 --> 00:34:59,848
Tam?

257
00:35:05,187 --> 00:35:07,523
Tammy, are you there?

258
00:35:12,820 --> 00:35:13,862
Tam?

259
00:35:13,988 --> 00:35:15,739
Tammy!

260
00:35:15,990 --> 00:35:18,033
Tammy!

261
00:35:54,445 --> 00:35:58,741
Tammy, this is stupid.
You're not being funny.

262
00:36:24,099 --> 00:36:26,560
I knew it.

263
00:36:46,955 --> 00:36:49,541
You're hurting me!

264
00:37:00,094 --> 00:37:03,472
No! No! No! No!

265
00:37:03,597 --> 00:37:05,808
No, don't go! No!

266
00:37:06,392 --> 00:37:08,018
No!

267
00:37:08,477 --> 00:37:09,561
No!

268
00:37:20,322 --> 00:37:23,033
Doyle.

269
00:37:23,158 --> 00:37:25,828
I got your puppies.

270
00:37:41,969 --> 00:37:44,054
No!

271
00:37:50,394 --> 00:37:53,856
Get off me! Get off me!

272
00:38:07,244 --> 00:38:10,497
I apologise for these precautions.

273
00:38:10,581 --> 00:38:15,878
It's standard protocol with any survivors,
though we haven't had to do it for a while.

274
00:38:16,003 --> 00:38:20,883
The last survivor we came across
was over two months ago.

275
00:38:22,384 --> 00:38:28,474
Can you tell me anything
about how you managed to keep alive

276
00:38:28,557 --> 00:38:30,559
while you were gone so long?

277
00:38:34,730 --> 00:38:37,733
Do you know of any other survivors?

278
00:38:41,236 --> 00:38:43,155
OK.

279
00:38:43,238 --> 00:38:46,992
I'm just going to take a blood sample.

280
00:38:47,075 --> 00:38:49,203
It won't hurt.

281
00:38:58,921 --> 00:39:02,925
Have you come into direct contact
with the infected?

282
00:39:13,227 --> 00:39:15,938
OK.

283
00:39:24,613 --> 00:39:26,907
I want to see my children.

284
00:39:30,911 --> 00:39:33,247
Of course. Of course.

285
00:39:53,809 --> 00:39:55,102
- Mr Harris.
- Yeah.

286
00:39:55,185 --> 00:39:59,314
- We've found your kids.
- Oh, thank God. Thank you so much.

287
00:39:59,439 --> 00:40:01,692
We found your wife, too.

288
00:40:13,120 --> 00:40:15,747
Can they hear me?

289
00:40:15,831 --> 00:40:19,793
- So, what do you two think you're playing at?
- You said you saw her die.

290
00:40:19,876 --> 00:40:22,504
- What?
- You said you saw her die!

291
00:40:26,133 --> 00:40:28,302
- I didn't say that.
- You did. You did.

292
00:40:28,385 --> 00:40:30,971
Baby, I didn't use those words.

293
00:40:31,054 --> 00:40:34,600
This is... I don't know.
I mean, it's confusing, you know.

294
00:40:34,683 --> 00:40:38,520
It's... it's very hard
for you to imagine, you know?

295
00:40:38,645 --> 00:40:42,524
- I... It's too hard to explain.
- Well, try to explain it, Dad! Try!

296
00:40:42,649 --> 00:40:47,321
Try? What do you want me to say?
I thought I saw Mum... die.

297
00:40:47,404 --> 00:40:50,991
Or I wouldn't have told you that.
I was sure.

298
00:40:53,201 --> 00:40:57,664
Look, guys, I'm not sure
what's happening here...

299
00:40:57,748 --> 00:41:00,167
but it's good. OK?

300
00:41:00,250 --> 00:41:03,045
That's the point. Mum's alive.

301
00:41:03,170 --> 00:41:05,422
I want to see her!

302
00:41:42,250 --> 00:41:45,045
There's no question, sir.

303
00:41:45,128 --> 00:41:47,422
She has the virus. She's infected.

304
00:41:49,132 --> 00:41:52,260
Why isn't she showing any symptoms?

305
00:41:52,928 --> 00:41:54,805
- I don't know.
- Speculate.

306
00:41:59,559 --> 00:42:03,605
A genetic abnormality which acts
as some sort of natural immunity?

307
00:42:03,730 --> 00:42:09,778
But the virus is still in her blood and saliva,
so technically she's not immune.

308
00:42:09,903 --> 00:42:12,072
She's a carrier.

309
00:42:12,155 --> 00:42:14,866
She has the ability to infect others?

310
00:42:14,950 --> 00:42:17,077
Yes, sir. Absolutely.

311
00:42:21,123 --> 00:42:24,626
If this woman has natural immunity
she is incredibly valuable.

312
00:42:24,751 --> 00:42:30,006
Her blood could contain
the key to a vaccine, even a cure.

313
00:42:37,639 --> 00:42:40,100
Alice.

314
00:42:44,521 --> 00:42:46,648
Hey, baby.

315
00:42:49,818 --> 00:42:53,363
Oh, I'm so sorry. I was scared.

316
00:42:57,325 --> 00:42:59,494
I shouldn't have run away.

317
00:42:59,619 --> 00:43:01,621
I was scared.

318
00:43:05,250 --> 00:43:07,627
Please forgive me.

319
00:43:07,711 --> 00:43:11,423
Please, sir. We need time to study her.
We need to run some tests.

320
00:43:11,506 --> 00:43:14,634
You can run tests on her corpse, Major.

321
00:43:17,721 --> 00:43:20,015
I love you, Don.

322
00:43:26,354 --> 00:43:28,482
Yeah.

323
00:43:30,567 --> 00:43:32,903
Oh, God, I love you, too.

324
00:44:48,103 --> 00:44:49,479
Don!

325
00:46:08,516 --> 00:46:12,938
Clear channels to control room.
Control room, this is General Stone.

326
00:46:13,021 --> 00:46:17,567
All forces under my control, prepare
to execute Code Red on my command.

327
00:46:17,692 --> 00:46:19,361
- Affirmative.
- Affirmative.

328
00:46:19,486 --> 00:46:23,281
Break, break, break, all stations.
Sunray in 30 seconds.

329
00:46:23,365 --> 00:46:27,285
We have an outbreak in the med centre.
All units, safeties off.

330
00:46:27,369 --> 00:46:30,038
- Affirmative.
- Open air cav transmission.

331
00:46:30,163 --> 00:46:34,584
- Prepare containment areas.
- Move civilians to containment areas.

332
00:46:34,709 --> 00:46:38,838
Command personnel secure in bunker.
Confirm order to lock down.

333
00:46:38,922 --> 00:46:41,257
Lockdown confirmed.

334
00:46:41,383 --> 00:46:43,677
Execute Code Red.

335
00:46:49,391 --> 00:46:54,521
Flynn, come in. Flynn, do you hear
that Code Red or am I losing my shit?

336
00:46:54,604 --> 00:46:56,523
I was about to ask the same thing.

337
00:46:59,567 --> 00:47:02,112
Ten-hut!

338
00:47:21,798 --> 00:47:26,761
Everything's fine. Don't worry.
I'll be back in a moment.

339
00:47:28,263 --> 00:47:32,100
- It's probably nothing.
- Tam, it didn't sound like nothing.

340
00:47:32,183 --> 00:47:34,602
He said he'd be back in a moment.

341
00:48:09,471 --> 00:48:11,765
Are you OK? Let's go.

342
00:48:14,684 --> 00:48:17,312
Come on.

343
00:48:18,438 --> 00:48:22,067
- Move, move, move! Let's go!
- Andy, keep hold of my hand.

344
00:48:22,150 --> 00:48:24,444
OK, come on. Keep it moving.

345
00:48:24,527 --> 00:48:26,654
Come on, people. Come on.

346
00:48:26,780 --> 00:48:30,450
- Don't push.
- Sir, all civilians into the containment area.

347
00:48:30,533 --> 00:48:36,081
These kids are with me. It's important they are
kept protected. I need to get them out of here.

348
00:48:36,164 --> 00:48:40,585
- Sir, no exceptions. It's a Code Red.
- I know what it is. My name is...

349
00:48:40,668 --> 00:48:42,420
- Andy!
- Scarlet!

350
00:48:42,504 --> 00:48:44,089
Andy!

351
00:48:44,172 --> 00:48:45,507
- Tammy!
- Andy!

352
00:48:45,590 --> 00:48:47,300
- Andy, wait!
- Scarlet!

353
00:48:47,383 --> 00:48:50,345
- Just wait, Andy! We're coming!
- Calm down.

354
00:48:59,229 --> 00:49:03,191
Move down. Move down the room.
Keep moving. Go, go, go. Come on.

355
00:49:03,316 --> 00:49:07,570
- You think it's a drill?
- Of course not. Someone saw an infected.

356
00:49:08,655 --> 00:49:11,783
Keep moving. That's it.
Good, good. Let's go.

357
00:49:11,866 --> 00:49:14,786
- Why are you sealing us inside?
- For your protection.

358
00:49:14,869 --> 00:49:18,748
- Just guard the door. Don't lock it.
- It's for your own protection.

359
00:49:18,873 --> 00:49:21,543
- We've got to find Andy.
- We'll find him.

360
00:49:46,359 --> 00:49:50,071
- Shut down civilian areas.
- Sector one, lockdown.

361
00:49:50,196 --> 00:49:54,742
- Sector eight, lockdown.
- Sector three, lockdown.

362
00:50:11,551 --> 00:50:16,347
Switch to emergency lighting.
Use of non-lethal force authorised.

363
00:50:16,431 --> 00:50:19,017
All snipers in position.

364
00:50:19,100 --> 00:50:23,980
- Ground forces to med centre.
- Ground force to med centre.

365
00:50:24,939 --> 00:50:26,941
Sector one covered.

366
00:50:33,448 --> 00:50:36,284
Everyone, stay calm.

367
00:50:57,263 --> 00:50:59,140
Dad.

368
00:51:16,199 --> 00:51:18,326
No! My dad... my dad!

369
00:51:20,036 --> 00:51:21,996
He's in here!

370
00:52:30,898 --> 00:52:32,317
No!

371
00:52:32,400 --> 00:52:37,697
Containment area, containment area,
move into position.

372
00:52:47,206 --> 00:52:48,499
No!

373
00:53:02,263 --> 00:53:04,640
I confirm, only target infected.

374
00:53:04,766 --> 00:53:07,143
Roger that. Only target infected.

375
00:53:15,401 --> 00:53:18,112
Targeting right. I've had two down.

376
00:53:21,282 --> 00:53:23,951
Watch out for the friendlies.

377
00:53:24,077 --> 00:53:26,412
I can't get a shot.

378
00:53:28,122 --> 00:53:30,792
Oh, man, this is FUBAR.

379
00:53:32,960 --> 00:53:35,713
We got a group there at 12 o'clock.

380
00:53:35,797 --> 00:53:41,302
- We've got one at three o'clock.
- On the ground, got four.

381
00:53:42,595 --> 00:53:44,764
16 down.

382
00:53:48,184 --> 00:53:50,645
I got two by the Jeep.

383
00:53:53,147 --> 00:53:56,484
- Jesus.
- I don't see who's a target.

384
00:54:00,363 --> 00:54:04,617
On the move! On the move!
Moving right! Moving right!

385
00:54:05,326 --> 00:54:09,372
I can't find
the designated target here.

386
00:54:09,831 --> 00:54:12,500
I cannot be target-specific.

387
00:54:12,625 --> 00:54:16,379
Whisky Three, why have you stopped firing?
Come in.

388
00:54:16,504 --> 00:54:21,926
Abandon selective targeting.
Shoot everything. Targets are now free.

389
00:54:22,009 --> 00:54:24,178
We've lost control.

390
00:54:29,350 --> 00:54:35,481
All units, all units, this is Medical
Commanding Officer Sierra Lima.

391
00:54:35,565 --> 00:54:39,527
Please be on the lookout for a young boy,
age 12, name, Andy.

392
00:54:42,530 --> 00:54:47,535
If he is located he must be immediately
evacuated from the containment zone.

393
00:54:47,618 --> 00:54:49,662
We have to find Andy.

394
00:54:49,745 --> 00:54:52,623
- We have to find him!
- It's OK. It's OK.

395
00:54:52,707 --> 00:54:56,419
We're gonna find him, OK?
We're gonna find him, I promise.

396
00:54:56,544 --> 00:55:02,216
I'm gonna get him out of here.
I'm gonna get you both out of here. Trust me.

397
00:55:23,070 --> 00:55:26,908
- New shot.
- Abandon selective targeting.

398
00:55:28,367 --> 00:55:32,747
- Confirm order?
- Target everyone at ground level.

399
00:55:32,872 --> 00:55:36,250
No exceptions. Repeat, no exceptions.

400
00:55:44,217 --> 00:55:45,426
Come on!

401
00:56:03,277 --> 00:56:06,906
Three down.
One of ours down there. Three o'clock.

402
00:56:20,586 --> 00:56:25,466
- Taking them down.
- Left sector, three o'clock.

403
00:56:27,593 --> 00:56:30,012
Kid! Over here!

404
00:56:30,137 --> 00:56:32,640
Kid! Over here!

405
00:56:46,487 --> 00:56:50,032
- I got him.
- Well, take him out. Take him out.

406
00:56:50,157 --> 00:56:53,661
Doyle, I got two fuckers on me!

407
00:56:55,037 --> 00:56:57,164
Fuck.

408
00:56:59,709 --> 00:57:01,836
Fuck.

409
00:57:11,178 --> 00:57:13,222
Fuck!

410
00:58:25,795 --> 00:58:27,213
Tam?

411
00:58:48,776 --> 00:58:50,861
This is madness.

412
00:58:51,946 --> 00:58:55,157
- What's happening?
- They're shooting everybody.

413
00:58:55,282 --> 00:59:00,371
- Why? It makes no sense.
- It makes perfect sense.

414
00:59:00,454 --> 00:59:02,331
It's Code Red.

415
00:59:15,302 --> 00:59:17,221
I saw Dad.

416
00:59:17,304 --> 00:59:19,724
Where?

417
00:59:19,807 --> 00:59:22,351
He's one of them.

418
00:59:23,519 --> 00:59:26,856
Step one, kill the infected.

419
00:59:26,981 --> 00:59:30,151
Step two, containment.

420
00:59:30,651 --> 00:59:32,945
If containment fails...

421
00:59:34,363 --> 00:59:37,324
step three, extermination.

422
00:59:37,950 --> 00:59:41,662
Now they won't stop until everyone is dead.

423
00:59:43,372 --> 00:59:45,499
So what do we do?

424
00:59:46,417 --> 00:59:50,463
I mean, I'm not sitting around here
to get exterminated.

425
00:59:50,546 --> 00:59:52,506
We've gotta get outta here.

426
00:59:52,631 --> 00:59:57,428
If we take one step out of that door,
if the infected don't get us, the snipers will.

427
00:59:57,511 --> 01:00:00,848
Well, you don't have a choice, my friend.

428
01:00:00,973 --> 01:00:05,561
Right now it's dark out there. The snipers
can see you through their night scopes,

429
01:00:05,686 --> 01:00:10,775
but at least you have
some limited cover from the infected.

430
01:00:10,858 --> 01:00:15,237
But, you know, if you wanna wait till sun-up
then you're as good as dead.

431
01:00:15,362 --> 01:00:17,531
Who are you?

432
01:00:17,656 --> 01:00:20,785
Sergeant Doyle. Delta rooftop unit.

433
01:00:21,327 --> 01:00:23,829
Why aren't you at your post?

434
01:00:24,872 --> 01:00:26,749
Why aren't you?

435
01:00:28,209 --> 01:00:33,672
Look, you guys do what you want,
but I'm gonna get the fuck outta here.

436
01:00:34,131 --> 01:00:36,675
You coming?

437
01:00:42,097 --> 01:00:44,099
All right, come on.

438
01:00:54,401 --> 01:00:56,904
- Less shooting.
- Maybe it's under control.

439
01:00:57,029 --> 01:00:59,406
Or there are less shooters.

440
01:01:00,074 --> 01:01:04,745
All right, listen. I need you guys
to look at me and only me, OK?

441
01:01:04,870 --> 01:01:08,415
You run when I run.
Be my shadow. That's it, all right?

442
01:01:08,541 --> 01:01:10,793
Get around back. Watch her.

443
01:01:12,586 --> 01:01:15,089
Ready? Let's go.

444
01:01:26,225 --> 01:01:28,644
Stay.

445
01:01:31,897 --> 01:01:34,400
Doyle, come in.

446
01:01:38,612 --> 01:01:42,575
- Flynn, go.
- Doyle, where the fuck are you, man?

447
01:01:46,120 --> 01:01:49,915
- Ground level, District One.
- Shit. Close frequency.

448
01:01:49,999 --> 01:01:52,126
Copy that.

449
01:01:54,420 --> 01:01:58,799
What the fuck are you doing there?
You got some serious shit coming your way.

450
01:01:58,924 --> 01:02:02,553
- We already got some serious shit.
- I'm not playing. This is worse.

451
01:02:02,636 --> 01:02:06,807
The air cav just got their orders.
They're firebombing all of District One.

452
01:02:06,932 --> 01:02:09,351
- That was fast.
- Outbreak is out of control.

453
01:02:09,476 --> 01:02:14,857
They're taking no chances. So unless you are
out of the target zone, you are getting cooked.

454
01:02:14,982 --> 01:02:18,402
- How long we got?
- They're on their way. Four minutes, tops.

455
01:02:18,485 --> 01:02:23,908
But listen. I got some clear landing ground
at Regent's Park. That's the pick-up point.

456
01:02:23,991 --> 01:02:29,121
- I'll be back in touch.
- Doyle, you fucking better be.

457
01:02:29,580 --> 01:02:33,375
All right, look, guys, we gotta run.
Just stay low and stay fast, OK?

458
01:02:33,500 --> 01:02:35,794
After me. Let's go.

459
01:02:42,635 --> 01:02:45,721
- Snipers! Get down! Snipers!
- Back! Back! Back!

460
01:02:45,846 --> 01:02:47,640
Get back! Get back!

461
01:02:47,723 --> 01:02:50,643
Andy, get back!

462
01:02:50,726 --> 01:02:53,687
- Back!
- Andy, get in!

463
01:02:55,981 --> 01:02:57,900
- Shit.
- Fuck!

464
01:02:58,025 --> 01:03:00,903
It's OK. It's just a flesh wound.

465
01:03:16,710 --> 01:03:18,712
Multiple shots, one hit.

466
01:03:20,089 --> 01:03:22,716
He's a panicker, no marksman.

467
01:03:28,055 --> 01:03:30,349
OK.

468
01:03:30,849 --> 01:03:32,601
- What's your name?
- Sam.

469
01:03:32,726 --> 01:03:36,313
OK, Sam. Come here. Get closer.
Do you see that doorway?

470
01:03:36,397 --> 01:03:42,277
I need you to run as fast as you can in a
zigzag like this, OK? Don't stop for anything.

471
01:03:42,403 --> 01:03:47,950
- You want me to be bait?
- He'll take shots at you, but he'll miss.

472
01:03:48,075 --> 01:03:51,996
He's gonna expose his position.
Means I get a shot at him. I won't miss.

473
01:03:52,079 --> 01:03:55,249
- You're out of your fucking mind.
- Stay back.

474
01:03:56,417 --> 01:04:00,796
Two minutes, we're all gonna die.
You want that?

475
01:04:00,921 --> 01:04:02,256
No!

476
01:04:02,381 --> 01:04:03,799
Andy!

477
01:04:03,924 --> 01:04:05,009
Fuck!

478
01:04:30,325 --> 01:04:32,619
Good work, kid.

479
01:04:39,418 --> 01:04:42,337
- The fence!
- Watch it, watch it. Behind me.

480
01:04:42,463 --> 01:04:44,465
Go! Go! Go!

481
01:04:47,259 --> 01:04:49,762
Come on. Come on, come on.

482
01:04:50,429 --> 01:04:52,473
Jump!

483
01:05:08,697 --> 01:05:11,658
This is Red Fox One pouring whisky.

484
01:05:14,036 --> 01:05:17,664
Keep going!
We'll be safe under the river.

485
01:07:02,102 --> 01:07:03,729
Go! Go!

486
01:07:06,982 --> 01:07:09,776
Come on. Come on!

487
01:07:15,324 --> 01:07:17,284
Run! Run!

488
01:07:31,965 --> 01:07:35,886
Bring in biological units.
Fan out from predesignated positions.

489
01:07:35,969 --> 01:07:38,305
Bio units, copy.

490
01:07:39,264 --> 01:07:45,479
Use of chemical weapons authorised.
Repeat, chemical weapons are authorised.

491
01:10:38,527 --> 01:10:40,654
Stay close.

492
01:10:59,005 --> 01:11:01,299
They left us again.

493
01:11:04,469 --> 01:11:07,305
Do you think Mum's still alive?

494
01:11:09,307 --> 01:11:11,351
Not this time.

495
01:11:46,052 --> 01:11:49,931
- You look a little pale.
- Blood makes me nauseous.

496
01:11:50,056 --> 01:11:53,185
You never answered my question.

497
01:11:53,268 --> 01:11:55,812
About why you left your post.

498
01:11:55,896 --> 01:11:58,190
When I got that boy in my sights.

499
01:12:02,277 --> 01:12:04,946
That's not a target any more.

500
